<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     0.54    vs   0.36</p>
<p>Group shares existing</p>
<p>    (cents)			   1.6     vs   1.3</p>
<p>    Fully diluted basis	   1.3     vs   nil</p>
