<p>    Operating profit		1.08    vs   0.64</p>
<p>    Interest expenses	     0.04    vs   0.05</p>
<p>    Tax				 0.01    vs   0.01</p>
<p>Extraordinaries (loss)	0.06    vs   nil</p>
<p>Note- Name of the company is Inter-Roller Engineering Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
